### 1. 회원가입 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester01",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE"
}

### 2. 로그인 테스트
# 응답의 token 값을 복사해서 아래 token 변수에 붙여넣기
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester01",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 로그인 응답의 token 값을 여기에 붙여넣기
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0ZXIwMSIsInJvbGUiOiJFTVBMT1lFRSIsImlhdCI6MTc3Nzg4MzkzMiwiZXhwIjoxNzc3ODg1NzMyfQ.xZcPcAV5N9zGqSpPsU1lUqNtKWr74ZWHsU0sC_buf6O8-QcPTuN4HvZn0_9PidfxAABwQ1SKQB_D_ZADPWc9NQ

### 3. 이상 상태 보고 테스트 (SLEEP)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/event
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "eventType": "SLEEP"
}

### 4. 다양한 이상 상태 테스트 (AWAY)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/event
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "eventType": "AWAY"
}

### 5. 정상 상태 보고 테스트 (NORMAL)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/event
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "eventType": "NORMAL"
}

### 6. 잘못된 유저 ID 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/event
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "employeeId": 9999,
  "eventType": "SLEEP"
}